TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Raw GitHub traffic API responses for public pollinations repos, appended daily by
    .github/workflows/data-sync-github-traffic-tinybird.yml. GitHub keeps traffic for 14 days
    only, so body is stored exactly as returned and interpreted in pipes.
    endpoint is views, clones, popular/paths or popular/referrers. Each fetch covers the
    14 days before fetched_at, so fetches overlap: never sum across them.

SCHEMA >
    `repo` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.repo`,
    `endpoint` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.endpoint`,
    `fetched_at` DateTime `json:$.fetched_at`,
    `body` String `json:$.body`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "repo, endpoint, fetched_at"
